{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"いこまだよ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夏がくるよ〜\nふぉっふぉいほぉっくす(ﾟ皿ﾟ)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ジャンプにこの前読み切りで磯部磯兵衛物語やってたのまたやらないかな〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"読んだ人います？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いこまあの感じ好きだったな〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"斉木楠雄のΨ難いつも面白い！\n楠雄はイケメンだと思います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あーほんとまんだらけとかとかに住みたい！\nガチで！\n夢は大きく！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でへっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2013/06/13/9270812/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"くーる！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へばなっ！"}],"source":"archive"}